@page
@model WoodruffDev.Pages.Services.FractionalArchitectModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Fractional Architect";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">Service</span>
        <h1>Fractional Architect</h1>
        <p>High-impact technical leadership&mdash;without the full-time overhead.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="service-detail fade-in">
            <h2>Service Overview</h2>
            <p>Not every organization needs a full-time architect, but every growing team needs architectural guidance. As a Fractional Architect, I partner with you to provide technical leadership, platform strategy, and architectural clarity&mdash;on a flexible schedule and at a fraction of the cost of a permanent hire. Whether you&rsquo;re building something new or fixing something fragile, I help ensure your software decisions scale with your business.</p>

            <h2>My Work Process</h2>
            <p>A practical, lightweight approach to driving technical clarity.</p>
            <h3>Step 1 &ndash; Discovery &amp; Alignment</h3>
            <p>We define your goals, pain points, and existing tech landscape in a focused kickoff session.</p>
            <h3>Step 2 &ndash; Architecture Engagement</h3>
            <p>I embed with your team on a fractional basis, typically 4&ndash;16 hours per week, providing guidance, architecture reviews, decision support, and mentoring.</p>
            <h3>Step 3 &ndash; Iteration &amp; Scaling</h3>
            <p>As your needs evolve, I adjust my involvement. Stepping in deeper during transitions or staying high-level when your team is stable.</p>

            <h2>Troubleshooting Process</h2>
            <p>When things break down, I help find what&rsquo;s broken and why. Sometimes systems slow, teams stall, or architectural choices don&rsquo;t age well. When that happens, I come in to assess and stabilize:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Conduct deep-dive technical assessments</li>
                <li>Identify architecture bottlenecks or failure points</li>
                <li>Guide teams through restructuring decisions</li>
                <li>Deliver actionable recommendations with no fluff</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Going Beyond the Usual</h2>
            <p><strong>Mentorship for Your Team</strong> &ndash; I don&rsquo;t just make decisions. I explain them. Your engineers grow as I guide.</p>
            <p><strong>Bridge Between Business and Dev</strong> &ndash; I translate goals into scalable architecture, while keeping leadership in the loop.</p>
            <p><strong>Flexible by Design</strong> &ndash; I adapt to your pace, team size, and current state. Whether that&rsquo;s chaos or calm.</p>

            <div class="service-nav">
                <a href="/Services/Advisory">&larr; Advisory &amp; Board Roles</a>
                <a href="/Services/ExpertWitness">Expert Witness &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
